#16100
The Isle of Mysts~
This is a collection of all the scraps of areas I had started and never
finished.
Turned out to be a complete island.
Players level 10 - 50, solo or grouped can find something here.
This area links to other areas, the swamp and the ocean.
A list of mobs and obj will follow.
~
